<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F12.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 12</span>. </span><span id="S3.F12.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Latency comparison of vLLM, gLLM and <span id="S3.F12.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">RServe</span> (logarithmic coordinate system).</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S3.F13" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
